{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/b4b686bf6beaab6f5db741ea449535c2.avif?t=1774005972\" width=750 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen lighting elevates retro 2.5D pixel art into cinematic medieval masterpieces. From storm-lashed towns to candlelit castles, the glint on knights' armor to the flicker of tavern hearths \u2014 every frame tells a grand saga. Total immersion awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.poster.avif?t=1774005972\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.webm?t=1774005972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/c93d69942f6cd2794ea454a88a285615.mp4?t=1774005972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/5623dac31eaeb3cb3d9cde0bea78598a.poster.avif?t=1774005972\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/5623dac31eaeb3cb3d9cde0bea78598a.webm?t=1774005972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/5623dac31eaeb3cb3d9cde0bea78598a.mp4?t=1774005972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/fe62e6a12853a4f10b7f03c2eeb366c4.avif?t=1774005972\" width=750 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every critical decision you make ripples through your companions' growth, convictions, and ultimate fates. Loyalty, betrayal, redemption... Your choices weave their legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/6a92feeb8e06a94380dbf1df1c3c3ee5.poster.avif?t=1774005972\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/6a92feeb8e06a94380dbf1df1c3c3ee5.webm?t=1774005972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/6a92feeb8e06a94380dbf1df1c3c3ee5.mp4?t=1774005972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/8c56e90d712596f569472bde46d244ab.avif?t=1774005972\" width=750 height=65 /></span>Forget mindless clicking! Deep class synergy, precise action order, and rich character traits forge intensely challenging and rewarding tactical combat. Every move demands cunning.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/ec4f2d6c3ee79043a3973f4aadc68aca.poster.avif?t=1774005972\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/ec4f2d6c3ee79043a3973f4aadc68aca.webm?t=1774005972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864890/extras/ec4f2d6c3ee79043a3973f4aadc68aca.mp4?t=1774005972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut